# CARTO basemap key — free, no account needed, takes a minute:
#   https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
#
# Without it the map still works, but CARTO stamps a repeated
# "API key required" watermark across the tiles. Fine locally, not in public.
#
# Copy this file to .env and paste your key below, then rebuild.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
